# UI/UX Design Rules

## Design Philosophy

### Core Principles
- **Minimalism First**: Remove unnecessary elements and decorations. Every element should serve a purpose.
- **StyleSheet Over Tailwind**: Use React Native StyleSheet for all styling - more maintainable and consistent.
- **Clear Visual Hierarchy**: Use typography, spacing, and color to guide user attention.
- **Reduced Clutter**: Simplify cards, remove excessive badges and overlays.
- **White Space**: More breathing room between elements improves readability and reduces cognitive load.
- **Clean Cards**: Simple, flat designs with subtle borders and NO shadows.
- **Consistent Spacing**: Use 8px/12px/16px grid system for consistency.
- **RTL First**: All layouts must support right-to-left by default using `flexDirection: 'row-reverse'`.

## Spacing System

### Base Spacing Units
- **xs**: 8px - Small gaps, tight spacing
- **sm**: 12px - Standard gaps, card padding
- **md**: 16px - Section margins, larger padding
- **lg**: 24px - Major section spacing
- **xl**: 32px - Screen-level spacing

### Spacing Guidelines
- Card padding: 12px-16px
- Section margins: 12px-16px
- Gap between cards: 8px-12px
- Internal element spacing: 8px-12px
- Screen edge padding: 16px

## Typography

### Font Families
- **Headers**: `Cairo_700Bold` - For titles and important text
- **Body**: `Cairo_500Medium` - For regular content
- **Labels**: `Cairo_500Medium` - For form labels and metadata

### Font Sizes
- **Large Title**: 24px - Hero sections, main titles
- **Title**: 18px - Section headers
- **Subtitle**: 16px - Card titles, important text
- **Body**: 14px - Regular content
- **Small**: 12px-13px - Labels, metadata, secondary text

### Typography Hierarchy
- Use size and weight to create clear hierarchy
- Maintain consistent line heights (1.4-1.6x font size)
- Text alignment: Right-to-left (RTL) for Arabic content

## Color Usage

### Primary Colors
- **Primary**: `#1E3A5F` - Main actions, important elements
- **Text**: `#1e293b` - Primary text color
- **Text Light**: `#64748b` - Secondary text, metadata
- **Background**: `#f8fafc` - Screen backgrounds
- **White**: `#FFFFFF` - Card backgrounds

### Accent Colors
- **Rating Gold**: `#F59E0B` - Star ratings
- **Error/Heart**: `#EF4444` - Error states, favorite icons
- **Success**: `#10B981` - Success states, checkmarks
- **Verified**: `#3b82f6` - Verification badges

### Border Colors
- **Light Border**: `#f1f5f9` - Card borders, dividers
- **Medium Border**: `#e2e8f0` - Input borders

## Component Design Patterns

### Cards
- **Border Radius**: 12px (standard), 8px (small elements)
- **Border**: 1px solid `#f1f5f9` (REQUIRED - no shadows)
- **Shadow**: NONE - Use borders exclusively
- **Padding**: 12px-16px
- **Background**: White `#FFFFFF`
- **Spacing**: 12px margin between cards
- **Implementation**: Always use StyleSheet, never Tailwind classes

### Buttons
- **Primary Button**: 
  - Background: Primary color
  - Text: White, bold
  - Border Radius: 12px
  - Padding: 14px vertical, 16px horizontal
- **Secondary Button**:
  - Background: `#f8fafc`
  - Text: Primary color or dark text
  - Border: 1px solid `#e2e8f0`
  - Border Radius: 12px

### Input Fields
- **Background**: `#f8fafc`
- **Border**: 1px solid `#e2e8f0`
- **Border Radius**: 8px-12px
- **Padding**: 10px-12px
- **Text Alignment**: Right (RTL)

### Badges & Tags
- **Size**: Small and unobtrusive
- **Border Radius**: 8px-16px (pill shape)
- **Padding**: 6px-12px horizontal, 4px-8px vertical
- **Background**: Light gray or primary color tint
- **Text**: Small (12px-13px)

## Layout Principles

### RTL (Right-to-Left) Support
- **CRITICAL**: Always use `flexDirection: 'row-reverse'` for ALL horizontal layouts
- **Text alignment**: `textAlign: 'right'` for ALL text elements
- **Icons**: Position on the right side
- **ScrollViews**: Use `transform: [{ scaleX: -1 }]` for horizontal RTL scrolling with nested scaleX: -1 on children
- **Headers**: Use row-reverse with right-aligned text
- **Badges**: Use row-reverse and flex-start for RTL badge rows
- **No LTR**: Never use `flexDirection: 'row'` - always row-reverse

### Grid & Lists
- Use consistent spacing between items (8px-12px)
- Cards should have equal margins on all sides
- Avoid excessive nesting
- Use FlashList for long lists

### Hero Sections
- Height: 35-40% of screen height (not too tall)
- Gradient overlays: Subtle (0.3-0.5 opacity)
- Information overlay: Clean, minimal badges
- Avoid excessive decorative elements

## Image Guidelines

### Image Display
- **Aspect Ratio**: Maintain consistent ratios
- **Border Radius**: 12px for cards, 16px for hero images
- **Placeholder**: Use light gray background `#f1f5f9` or `#f8fafc`
- **Overlays**: Minimal, only when necessary for text readability

### Image Sizing
- Hero images: Full width, 200-250px height
- Card images: Full width, 160-180px height
- Avatar images: 48px-80px (circular)

## Interaction Design

### Touch Targets
- Minimum size: 44x44px
- Adequate padding around interactive elements
- Clear visual feedback on press

### Animations
- Keep animations subtle and fast (200-300ms)
- Use native driver for performance
- Avoid excessive animations

### Loading States
- Show skeleton loaders or simple spinners
- Maintain layout structure during loading

## Form Design

### Input Groups
- Label above input (RTL aligned)
- Clear placeholder text
- Error states: Red border, error message below
- Success states: Green checkmark or border

### Selection Elements
- Checkboxes: Simple, clear selected state
- Radio buttons: Clear visual distinction
- Dropdowns: Clean, minimal design

## Service-Specific Patterns

### Service List (Profile-Based)
- Profile avatar (56-72px circular) on right
- Name and category in same row
- Category and location combined: "Category • Location"
- Rating and price in same row (flex layout)
- Verified badge on avatar
- Heart icon for favorites
- Clean list item with dividers
- No cards - simple list layout

### Service Detail (Business Profile Style)
- **Large Banner Image** (300px height):
  - Full-width background image
  - Dark overlay gradient at bottom (50% height)
  - Company info overlaid on banner:
    - Company name (large white text)
    - Badges row (Busy status, Company/Freelancer type)
    - Category and location: "Category • Location"
    - Small square avatar (70-80px) with verified badge on right
- **Statistics Section** (3 columns):
  - Years of Experience
  - Projects count
  - Rating with star icon
- **Info Buttons**:
  - Language button (globe icon)
  - Response Time button (clock icon)
- **About Section**: Description text
- **Services Offered**: List with checkmarks
- **Gallery**: Horizontal scrollable images
- **Reviews Section**: Average rating and review cards
- **Bottom Booking Bar**: Price on left, "Book Now" button on right

## Responsive Design

### Screen Size Detection
```typescript
const { width, height } = Dimensions.get('window');
const isTablet = width >= 768;
const isSmallScreen = width < 375;
```

### Responsive Sizing
- **Fonts**: Scale by 2-4px between sizes
- **Spacing**: Scale by 4-8px between sizes
- **Avatars**: 56px (default), 72px (tablet), 50px (small)
- **Icons**: 14-16px (default), 18-20px (tablet), 12-14px (small)
- **Banners**: 300px (default), 320px (tablet), 240px (small)

### Responsive Patterns
- Use function-based styles: `const getStyles = () => StyleSheet.create({...})`
- Apply responsive values directly in style definitions
- Test on multiple screen sizes

## Best Practices

### Do's
- ✅ Use consistent spacing (8px/12px/16px grid)
- ✅ Maintain clear visual hierarchy
- ✅ Keep designs simple and clean
- ✅ Use white space effectively
- ✅ Ensure RTL support throughout
- ✅ Use subtle borders instead of heavy shadows
- ✅ Keep typography consistent
- ✅ Remove unnecessary decorative elements
- ✅ Make all screens responsive
- ✅ Use banner images for service profiles
- ✅ Overlay company info on banners for better UX

### Don'ts
- ❌ Don't use excessive gradients or overlays
- ❌ Don't add too many badges or tags
- ❌ Don't use heavy shadows (prefer borders)
- ❌ Don't overcrowd cards with information
- ❌ Don't use inconsistent spacing
- ❌ Don't ignore RTL layout requirements
- ❌ Don't use too many font sizes
- ❌ Don't add decorative elements without purpose
- ❌ Don't forget responsive sizing
- ❌ Don't use fixed pixel values without responsive alternatives

## Accessibility

### Text Contrast
- Ensure sufficient contrast between text and background
- Use WCAG AA standards (4.5:1 for normal text)

### Touch Accessibility
- All interactive elements should be easily tappable
- Provide clear visual feedback

### Screen Reader Support
- Use semantic HTML/React Native components
- Provide meaningful labels

